      "thesis": [
        "A conditional research capitalization can be stated because the price session is on or after the filing's quoted dividend trade date and the share-count cross-foot is exact.",
        "Parent profit in the reported column cross-foots to total profit, so a price-to-that-column ratio can be shown with an interim label."
      ],
      "counter_thesis": [
        "One blocked strict multiple does not remove the other labeled research figures.",
        "The share count is not current-common-outstanding authority.",
        "No target price or probability is implied.",
        "The pre-dividend share count under the post-trade price is unusable."
      ],
      "reading_notes": [
        "Research capitalization uses the owner-accepted thousand-VND close and the same-filing post-dividend share count.",
        "The close is not a verified endpoint unit and is not a qualified raw-as-traded price.",
        "Interim parent-profit multiple eligibility is CONDITIONAL_RESEARCH_ESTIMATE; it is a reported-period column, not annual or TTM P/E.",
        "Total-equity multiple eligibility is CONDITIONAL_RESEARCH_ESTIMATE; the denominator includes non-controlling interests and is not parent-shareholder P/B.",
        "P/E TTM, parent P/B and EV/EBITDA stay unusable until their own evidence exists.",
        "Research share count 8442964520 comes from one filing. A provider field that repeats it is not a second source.",
        "Operating cash flow and parent profit share a consolidated column. The ratio is group cash flow over parent-attributable profit, not a parent-only cash conversion.",
        "Cash-conversion status is VISUAL_REVIEW_RATIO_NOT_ADMITTED."
      ],
